  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">02.EU acquis related activities for Environment and Climate Action policies in Montenegro - ME2021AAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action is part of Action plan composed by actions in the areas of Environment, Transport, Agriculture plus EU Integration Facility and EU Reform Facility.The purpose of this Action is to assist Montenegro by contributing to the development of technical capacities for the protection of the environment, improvement of its quality and contributing to the preparation and implementation of policies related to climate change, biodiversity protection and accelerating the shift towards a low-carbon economy.This Action is aiming to support the implementation and enforcement of the EU Environmental acquis, according to the principles and benchmarks arising from the Negotiating Chapter 27.</narrative>
  </description>
